%% Courier marks a parcel DELIVERED with a photo proof (M4), and how the change fans out.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Courier (web, /courier/parcels/{id})
  participant W as Web BFF
  participant G as API gateway
  participant P as parcel-service
  participant S as RustFS (S3)
  participant DB as parcel DB
  participant K as Kafka
  participant X as tracking, notification,<br/>webhook, dispatch, reporting

  C->>W: POST courier/parcels/{id}/proof-upload-url (type, size)
  W->>G: forward with access token
  G->>P: JWT checked, role COURIER
  P->>P: parcel assigned to caller? (else 404)
  P->>S: presign PUT for proofs/{parcelId}/{proofId}
  P-->>C: proofId, uploadUrl, expiresAt
  C->>S: PUT photo (direct, with progress)
  S-->>C: 200

  C->>W: PATCH courier/parcels/{id}/status {DELIVERED, proof: PHOTO, proofId, receivedBy}
  W->>G: forward
  G->>P: JWT checked
  P->>P: state OUT_FOR_DELIVERY -> DELIVERED allowed, proof present
  rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    note over P,DB: one transaction
    P->>DB: update parcel (version check)
    P->>DB: insert status history row
    P->>DB: mark proof used
    P->>DB: insert outbox row ParcelStatusChanged (with traceparent)
  end
  P-->>C: 200 parcel (422 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION, 409 PARCEL_MODIFIED)

  loop outbox relay
    P->>K: publish swiftdrop.parcel.status-changed.v1
  end
  K-->>X: consume (idempotent by eventId)
  X-->>C: live timeline update, email/SMS, merchant webhook
